# Ctrl+Z undoes typing in edit mode, a run of characters at a time, and Ctrl+Y redoes it.
file <<END
- Plan
END
see Plan
keys <Enter>
type  the party
keys <Left> <Left> <Left> <Left> <Left>
type big
keys <C-z>
see - Plan the party
keys <C-z>
hide party
keys <C-y>
see - Plan the party
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Plan the party
END
